@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Organization

actor "User" as User
participant "OrganizationView" as OrgView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

User -> OrgView : 1 Open organization view page
activate OrgView
OrgView -> OrgView : 2 Display organization details

OrgView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request organization info
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch organization data
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve organization record
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return organization data
ClerkAuth -> OrgView : 7 Return organization info
OrgView -> User : 8 Display organization details

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate OrgView

@enduml
